      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹、樱花千代王和\n八重无敌一起被观众们认可为“三强”，\n她们一同分享这份喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b6060d7ca5efa491390bc96894aab5a59ec17cadcde5c27481685f0addc524",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
