      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹用尽所有力量后，\n在训练员的搀扶下，\n享受着祝福她的欢呼声响彻会场──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5e537117f37d6de27ccf343f7fc652defe6e24da962739727737817188c2ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
